i_auto":"狐，姓也。春秋之时，晋有狐突、狐毛、狐偃父子。左传：齐简公与妇人饮酒于檀台。檀衢，意其地为通檀台之衢路也。尔雅：四达谓之衢。咺，况晚翻，又况远翻。斮，侧略翻，斩也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"8ca43820-db0e-11ef-a4d8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"州綽","people_name_jianti_auto":"州绰","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8ca4382e-db0e-11ef-b7c4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"杜預","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜预","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8ca4382f-db0e-11ef-bdf1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8ca43830-db0e-11ef-b6b7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8ca43831-db0e-11ef-b4a3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東閭","place_name_jianti_auto":"东闾","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8ca43832-db0e-11ef-9f9c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8ca43833-db0e-11ef-9e97-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"左傳：晉圍齊，州綽門于東閭。杜預註曰：齊東門。","note_content_jianti_auto":"左传：晋围齐，州绰门于东闾。杜预注曰：齐东门。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"8ca4382d-db0e-11ef-a8a6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-323,"link_death_year":-284,"link_td_description":"齐湣王，妫姓，田氏，名地，一名遂，战国时期齐国君主。在位十七年，屡建武功，破秦、燕诸国，制楚，灭宋。但也是其在位期间遭到五国合纵攻齐，齐国几乎遭到灭亡。","link_td_id":"Q10000622","link_td_number_id":320023,"people_name":"齊湣王","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐湣王","people_xingming":"田地","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8ca43836-db0e-11ef-a55f-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[田地]"},{"people_name":"狐咺","people_name_jianti_auto":"狐咺","people_xingming":"狐咺","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"8ca43837-db0e-11ef-a8ac-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-399,"link_death_year":-285,"link_td_description":"陈举，战国后期齐国人，齐国宗室，也叫做田举，因劝谏齐湣王被处死。","link_td_id":"