dd-dd12-435e-a66e-d1a5b3e173e1","source_start_index":225,"source_text":"南侵楚，西侵三晋，欲并二周为天子"}],"path":"随笔/卷十/战国自取亡","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":["内政","权争"],"content":"3齊湣王旣滅宋而驕，乃南侵楚，西侵三晉，欲幷二周，爲天子。狐咺正議，斮之檀衢。陳舉直言，殺之東閭。","content_fanyi":"齐湣王灭掉宋国之后十分骄横，于是向南侵犯楚国，向西侵犯赵、魏、韩三国，又想并吞东周和西周，最终自己做天子。狐咺因直言劝谏，被湣王斩杀并抛尸在檀台的要道上。陈举因直言敢谏，被杀死在齐都的东门外。","content_jianti_auto":"3齐湣王既灭宋而骄，乃南侵楚，西侵三晋，欲幷二周，为天子。狐咺正议，斮之檀衢。陈举直言，杀之东闾。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":335,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8ca4381f-db0e-11ef-a6c5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"齊桓公","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐桓公","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8ca43842-db0e-11ef-b501-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"田氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"田氏","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8ca43843-db0e-11ef-b69f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"毅，魚器翻。自齊桓公霸天下，國以強大；田氏藉其餘業。","note_content_jianti_auto":"毅，鱼器翻。自齐桓公霸天下，国以强大；田氏藉其余业。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"8ca43841-db0e-11ef-a58f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"使者，上疏吏翻。令，力丁翻。以利誘之曰嚪。嚪，音田濫翻。誘，羊久翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"使者，上疏吏翻。令，力丁翻。以利诱之曰嚪。嚪，音田滥翻。诱，羊久翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"8ca43845-db0e-11ef-a643-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"燕昭王","people_name_jianti_auto":"燕昭王","people_xingming":"姬平","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8ca43847-db0